graph TD
    A[START: User Question] --> B[Router Agent]
    
    B -->|Analizza domanda| C{Decisione}
    
    C -->|Direct Answer| D[Generator Agent - Direct]
    C -->|Use RAG| E[Retriever Agent]
    
    E -->|Cerca documenti| F[Vector Store - ChromaDB]
    F -->|Top-K documenti| G[Generator Agent - RAG]
    
    D -->|Risposta| H[END]
    G -->|Risposta + Sources| H
    
    style B fill:#ff9999
    style E fill:#99ccff
    style D fill:#99ff99
    style G fill:#99ff99
    style C fill:#ffcc99
